Heh, I used to feel the same way. I'm not sure whether you want to be
spoiled or not....so all I will say is, create a stash somewhere (a
chest, or room you can lock - chest is better, since some creatures can
tunnel) and put everything you find there until you have some way to
identify it. Obviously, some things are NOT worth carrying...rocks for
example, without giving much away. Eventually, you will learn what to
keep and what to toss.

Fight the urge to walk around burdened...YES, it will make you
stronger.... But, you move and (more importantly) fight slower. There
are a few other bad benefits, as well....


If you find the correct type of shop, you can sell things you don't
want anymore. But, if you don't really know what it is you are selling,
do you think you are going to get a fair price??



