You can use the number pad, the cursor keys, or the mouse to move. You
may have to go into options (shift-O) or the config file (defaults.nh,
i think) to enable it. The HJKLYUBN controls are second nature if you
have been playing a long time (since earlier versions did not support
the number pad), but I prefer the num pad, too. There are a few other
shortcuts associated with the num-pad, too.




